{
  "about": "Proposed Declaration Documentation expectations shared by both Cores (#436, part of #370). Awaiting first-blessing review: agreement between the Cores is not approval. A doc row is [origin, declaration, clause, text]; a unit's docs list each top-level declaration in source order as [declaration, text].",
